Z||000028||Jake_Dragon||06-14-2001||07:21 PM||||The cutting is the hardest part, blow up the resolution and use the eraser.<P>After you have the background done you can use the magic wand and select the aria you just erased than shift-ctrl-I now you are ready to use some filters. When you are done do the magic wand and shift-ctrl-I again and copy and paste it into a new picture. Change the resolution and Choose File &gt; Export &gt; GIF89a.<BR>Try it a few times and you will get the hang of it.<BR>HTH<BR>||||reg||1
